<title>USA: Pittway files for NYSE listing.</title>
<headline>Pittway files for NYSE listing.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pittway Corp said Monday it applied to list its common and class A shares on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>It said it anticipates trading on the New York Stock Exchange will begin in early October under the symbols PRY for common shares and PRYA for class A stock.</p>
<p>The company has about 3.9 million common shares and 17 million class A shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
